msgid ""
"\n"
"Of those, these can be subscribed to on the Mod Hub:"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"其中以下項目可以在 Mod Hub 上訂閱："

msgid ""
"\n"
"The dependencies are installed and can be activated.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"相依模組已安裝，且可啟用。\n"

msgid ""
"\n"
"You can:\n"
" - cancel the activation of this mod;\n"
" - skip activating its dependencies; or\n"
" - proceed with the activation of all dependent mods."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"你可以：\n"
" - 取消啟用這個模組；\n"
" - 跳過啟用其相依模組之步驟；或者\n"
" - 啟用所有相依模組後繼續操作。"

msgid ""
"\n"
"You can:\n"
" - cancel the activation of this mod; or\n"
" - ignore this warning (note the this might result in unstable gameplay)."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"你可以：\n"
" - 取消啟用這個模組；或者\n"
" - 忽略這個警告（但請注意此舉可能導致遊戲不穩定）。"

msgid ""
"\n"
"You can:\n"
" - cancel the activation of this mod; or\n"
" - proceed without these dependencies."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"你可以：\n"
" - 取消啟用這個模組；或者\n"
" - 不安裝相依模組，繼續操作。"

msgid ""
"\n"
"You can:\n"
" - cancel the deactivation of this mod;\n"
" - proceed and deactivate the mod anyways (this might lead to errors)."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"你可以：\n"
" - 取消停用此模組；\n"
" - 繼續操作並強制停用此模組（可能會引發錯誤）。"

msgid ""
"\n"
"You can:\n"
" - subscribe to the dependencies;\n"
" - cancel the activation of this mod; or\n"
" - proceed without these dependencies."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"你可以：\n"
" - 訂閱相依項；\n"
" - 取消啟用此模組；或\n"
" - 在沒有這些相依項的情況下繼續。"

